{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34380","headline":"润州送人往长洲 · 陆龟蒙","name":"润州送人往长洲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋来频上向吴亭，每上思归意剩生。\n废苑池台烟里色，夜村蓑笠雨中声。\n汀洲月下菱船疾，杨柳风高酒斾轻。\n君住松江多少日，爲尝鲈鱠与蓴羹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}